<P STYLE="color: #12CDFF; font: bold 9pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 0.1in">ADJUSTED NET REVENUE</P>

<P STYLE="color: #003854; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 0.1in; text-align: justify">Adjusted net revenue from sanitation
services, considering FAUSP and taxes, totaled R$ 6,021 mn in 1Q26, an increase of +10.9% vs 1Q25. The main factors that impacted revenue
in the period were:</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="color: #003854; font: bold 9pt/115% Tahoma, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal; color: #12CDFF">&#183;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">+11.9% in net price: <FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">+9.1%
tariff phase-in and +2.8% due to commercial initiatives (large clients and revenue assurance);</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="color: #003854; font: bold 9pt/115% Tahoma, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal; color: #12CDFF">&#183;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">+2.4% in volume: <FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">New
units +2.9%, partially offset by lower average temperature (3.3)&ordm;C and lower reservoir levels, affecting consumption per capita negatively;</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="color: #003854; font: bold 9pt/115% Tahoma, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal; color: #12CDFF">&#183;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">(3.4)% in mix: <FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">Growth
in units with access to subsidized rates;</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="color: #003854; font: 10pt/115% Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 6pt 0 6pt 0.5in; text-indent: 0in"><FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">&nbsp;</FONT></P>


